  "description": "FlowLite is a high-performance, thread-safe, and developer-friendly finite state machine (FSM) library for .NET. It helps you manage entity state transitions, workflow automation, and domain-driven state logic in a structured and testable way. Features: fluent API for state and trigger configuration, async support for transition logic, export as Mermaid.js or DOT graph, built-in JSON and in-memory storage.",
