  "releaseNotes": "- Added support for .NET 8.0;\n            - Fluent transition builder with `.AsFinal()`;\n            - Fluent transition builder with `.MarkForDeletion()` (delete entity);\n            - Create a configuration with FlowTransitionBuilder usage;\n            - Export FSM as Mermaid or DOT diagram;\n            - Pluggable state storage: JSON / InMemory;\n            - Thread-safe design with async-locking;",
  "repository": "",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "A high-performance state machine for .NET 8+ with fluent API and export support (Mermaid/DOT).",
